+# @expected-epoch: Plan's native epoch.
+# @expected-generation: Plan's owner generation.
+# @expected-state-sha256: Plan's complete selected-device proof digest.
+# @expected-batch-sha256: Plan's exact ordered encoding digest.
+# @edges: Exact ordered request used to create the plan.
